+## restriction-room
+
+*error: there is room to brake for a restriction*
+
+A train cannot be brought down to this restriction inside the scheme. The braking wanted, from line speed on the gradients the train meets, is longer than the track behind it.
+
+**What to do:** Move the restriction, raise the speed it is written at, or take the approach into the scheme next door and agree the warning board with whoever signals it.
